  "verdict": "**OTE setup closed \u2014 no trustworthy coherent edge.** All three configs pass V1\u2013V6 with zero incoherent booked trades, but Frame B economics are near breakeven (OTE705/62) or modestly positive (FVG-only) and **none fit Apex tier-1 DLL** at \\/yr sizing. Recommend pivot to H7 opening gap or TTrades CISD entry with harness enforced from first run.",
  "operator_summary": "1. **Why wrong-side trades appeared booked:** Trade log lacked stop/target columns; V1 harness joined setup metadata incorrectly (55% false incoherent). Guard ran at order submission but ledger wrote rows without bracket metadata or final geometry check. Fix: bracket fields on SimulatedFill \u2192 ledger; `_finalize_round()` rejects incoherent rounds; stop_price/target_price/entry_bar on every booked row.\n\n2. **Parity verdict:** M4 is authoritative. Hand trace (M4-equivalent stop-first + tag slippage + $1.98 RT) matches M4 on the majority of samples. Bespoke legacy sim omits exit slippage and diverges ~$7\u201311/trade.\n\n3. **Clean harness-passing OTE numbers (Frame B 2021\u20132025, 1 MNQ, comm+slip):**\n   - OTE705: 10,680 booked | $1,122/yr | 0.17 ticks/tr | 46.1% WR\n   - OTE62: 10,859 booked | $975/yr | 0.36 ticks/tr | 40.3% WR\n   - FVG_only: 6,878 booked | $2,750/yr | 4.52 ticks/tr | 35.1% WR\n\n4. **Trustworthy coherent edge?** **Marginal only \u2014 fails DLL.** Near-breakeven economics after artifact removal; no config fits Apex tier-1 DLL at $30K/yr sizing."
}